Cell["\<\
What Disney's \[Alpha] actually renders once you crank g (estimated through \
van de Hulst's forward formula):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0a2520aa-1ce2-4710-9fa9-5374d69d0b14"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Plot[Evaluate[Table[AvdH[alphaChiang[A0], g], {A0, {0.2, 0.5, 0.8}}]], {g, 0, \
0.95},
 PlotRange -> {0, 1}, Frame -> True, ImageSize -> 500,
 GridLines -> {{0.8}, {0.2, 0.5, 0.8}}, PlotTheme -> \"WarmColor\",
 PlotLegends -> {\"picked A = 0.2\", \"picked A = 0.5\", \"picked A = 0.8\"},
 FrameLabel -> {\"g\", \"rendered A\"}]\
