Cell["Where Pixar's fit runs out (mid gray, A = 0.5):", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1a209c13-bafb-4a41-ab1d-5914d7937601"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Plot[{alphaVdH[0.5, g], alphaPixarRaw[0.5, g]}, {g, -0.5, 0.95},
