Cell["\<\
Near white: mean bounces before absorption, 1/(1 \[Minus] \[Alpha]), against \
a typical bounce limit of 256.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3925219c-ba11-4b9b-929e-55281be7f4f5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
LogPlot[{1/(1 - alphaChiang[A]), 1/(1 - alphaVdH[A]), 1/(1 - alphaPixar[A, \
0])}, {A, 0.5, 0.999},
 Frame -> True, ImageSize -> 500, GridLines -> {None, {256}},
 PlotStyle -> {Thick, Directive[Thick, Orange], Directive[Thick, Dashed, \
Green]},
 PlotLegends -> {\"Disney\", \"Imageworks\", \"Pixar\"},
 FrameLabel -> {\"A\", \"mean bounces before absorption\"}]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[47]:=",ExpressionUUID->"aef748fe-d25c-4c38-bbdc-cbef93b836b8"],

